                  Transparent and personalized fees
               </h1>
               <div class="prices__text fs-20 t-center">
                  Each face is unique. Prices vary depending on individual needs
                  and treatment plans. Below you will find an overview of
                  standard fees for aesthetic surgery and non-surgical
                  procedures.
